on_ja":"空腹や疲れなどの体のサインが、選択にどう影響するか","speaking_prompt_en":"Speak for 60–90 seconds about how signals such as hunger or tiredness affect your choices. Give one concrete example and explain why it matters to you.","speaking_prompt_ja":"空腹や疲れなどの体のサインが、選択にどう影響するかについて60〜90秒で話してください。具体例を1つ挙げ、自分にとってなぜ大切かも説明しましょう。","essay_prompt_en":"Write 100–180 words about how signals such as hunger or tiredness affect your choices. Give a clear reason, one supporting example and a final takeaway.","essay_prompt_ja":"空腹や疲れなどの体のサインが、選択にどう影響するかについて100〜180語で書いてください。理由・具体例・最後のまとめを入れましょう。","challenge":"Stretch","phrases":["I’m getting hungry.","I’m starting to feel tired.","I should probably …"],"vocabulary":["appetite","energy","signal","well-being"]}]'::jsonb),
    ('july-26', '[{"key":"realistic-hope","title_en":"A realistic hope","title_ja":"実現できそうな希望","description_en":"Something you hope will happen and the action you can take toward it.","description_ja":"実現してほしいことと、そのために自分ができる行動","speaking_prompt_en":"Speak for 60–90 seconds about something you hope will happen and the action you can take toward it. Give one concrete example and explain why it matters to you.","speaking_prompt_ja":"実現してほしいことと、そのために自分ができる行動について60〜90秒で話してください。具体例を1つ挙げ、自分にとってなぜ大切かも説明しましょう。","essay_prompt_en":"Write 100–180 words about something you hope will happen and the action you can take toward it. Give a clear reason, one supporting example and a final takeaway.","essay_prompt_ja":"実現してほしいことと、そのために自分ができる行動について100〜180語で書いてください。理由・具体例・最後のまとめを入れましょう。","challenge":"Core","phrases":["I hope I can …","I’m working toward …","There’s a good chance …"],"vocabulary":["hope","opportunity","effort","realistic"]},{"key":"present-wish","title_en":"A wish about now","title_ja":"今についての願い","description_en":"Something you wish were different in your present situation.","description_ja":"今の状況で、違っていたらよいと思うこと","speaking_prompt_en":"Speak for 60–90 seconds about something you wish were different in your present situation. Give one concrete example and explain why it matters to you.","speaking_prompt_ja":"今の状況で、違っていたらよいと思うことについて60〜90秒で話してください。具体例を1つ挙げ、自分にとってなぜ大切かも説明しましょう。","essay_prompt_en":"Write 100–180 words about something you wish were different in your present situation. Give a clear reason, one supporting example and a final takeaway.","essay_prompt_ja":"今の状況で、違っていたらよいと思うことについて100〜180語で書いてください。理由・具体例・最後のまとめを入れましょう。","challenge":"Core","phrases":["I wish I were …","If only I had …","Right now, …"],"vocabulary":["wish","situation","impossible","change"]},{"key":"past-regret","title_en":"Learning from a regret","title_ja":"過去の後悔から学ぶ","description_en":"A past choice you wish you had handled differently and what you learned.","description_ja":"違う対応をすればよかったと思う過去の選択と、そこか